+// C2. multi-film mean rounding order (1351-C2 pin, per the parent's 1351-C2
+// decision on finding 5): each counted film's score is rounded half up to
+// integer tenths ONCE; filmsTenths is then the mean of those integer tenths,
+// rounded half up ONCE. This is "round-then-average-then-round" (Method A,
+// adopted), not "average-raw-then-round-once" (Method B, rejected).
